      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在回自己房间的路上，我看到北港火山像是站在那儿等着我。\n我正心想是怎么回事，一走近――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e524b0369b1f465260a3015df42ce3c563da5831004d36dff241de48f62388b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
