    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff267ec6d7fe6af75ebc3f67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我正好就着她刚才的计划讨论研究出了办活动的方案。\n机会难得，先告诉她吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c27311c7d04ebca17ac69aed83078826826b06eba141210cce317aa17cc74e9",
