      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得首先有必要让更多的人知道我本人……\n训练员，你是怎么想的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9db223adf84305b4c9ea0e158e53cfad57a00125bf781462280116fa17398aa1",
