      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以说，没关系了！　今后也像这样\n踏踏实实地搞街头演唱会就足够了！　失陪了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e0e72257a0d9eff4f143da7022242926b61ac1cef4720596239efe665fc9574",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
