      "uid": "zhcn:c0c087fe949a5a277b0c1270",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……确实，做活动是个蛮困难的议题。\n搞街头演唱会就属于最稳健的一条道路了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c8440510fa26c39d99ad31c86bd43b28a8d686c79f5aa9b1a837df761dc5b2d",
